0..75 Comment "// A dependent case over the circle owes the transport of its answer at the"
76..150 Comment "// point along the loop, through each endpoint\'s maps (#425): a map of any"
151..227 Comment "// arity whose one argument the point runs through, a loop arm answering the"
228..305 Comment "// loop by its name, and the definitions those maps call, unfolded within the"
306..380 Comment "// obligation\'s budget. A row the tree refuses today states the refusal it"
381..418 Comment "// meets and the issue that holds it."
